        "TileImage": "$($repository 0d4727a6-da97-49c4-b46d-a42b82406e1a).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Mendoza,\rwe are here to bring peace to the fragile work environment at the vineyard. We have to take care of employees that disturb the peace. In addition we will release an employee of ours that is here to reach out to the competition. She is attending the party and will try to blend in the crowd. \r\rTo avoid suspision stick to one cover.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.\rHappy hunting.",
